<title>USA: Imperial Bancorp board sets 3-for-2 split.</title>
<headline>Imperial Bancorp board sets 3-for-2 split.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Imperial Bancorp said Friday its board had approved a three-for-two stock split, payable October 18, record October 11.</p>
<p>On completion of the split, Imperial said it will have about 23 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
